## Third-party attribution

The layered memory design in this project is derived from dsh-memory-evolve:

```
dsh-memory-evolve
https://github.com/csyangwen/dsh-memory-evolve
MIT License
Copyright (c) 2026 dsh-external
```

No source code from that project is included here. What was adopted is the
design concept only:

- five-track layering of memory
- injection at session start rather than full-context loading
- a two-step confirmation path for entries injected every turn
- archiving deletions rather than erasing them
- writing a single entry when a turn ends

The implementation in this repository is independent and targets Google
Antigravity. The upstream project targets DeepSeek Harness via the Cordis
plugin framework; the two share no code.

The upstream project's MIT License continues to apply to its own code. Full
details in [docs/ATTRIBUTION.md](docs/ATTRIBUTION.md).

